#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:1
msgid "端到端数据流"
msgstr "End-to-End Data Flow"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:3
msgid ""
"本文从应用数据出发, 追踪一个数据包从发送端到接收端经过的完整处理链路, 涵盖 MAC "
"层封装、信道编码、调制成型、空口传输、接收解调和数据恢复的全过程。"
msgstr ""
"Starting from application data, this article traces the complete processing "
"pipeline of a data packet from the transmitter to the receiver, covering "
"MAC-layer encapsulation, channel coding, modulation and pulse shaping, over-"
"the-air transmission, reception and demodulation, and data recovery."

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:5
msgid "全局视图"
msgstr "Global View"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:27
msgid "发射流水线"
msgstr "Transmit Pipeline"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:29
msgid "第一步: QoS 决策"
msgstr "Step 1: QoS Decision"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:31
msgid "`SleNode.transmit()` 首先调用 `QosManager.prepare_tx()`, 从优先级队列中取出待发送数据:"
msgstr ""
"`SleNode.transmit()` first calls `QosManager.prepare_tx()`, which fetches "
"data to send from the priority queue:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:33
msgid "五级优先级队列: CONTROL > REALTIME > HIGH > NORMAL > LOW"
msgstr "Five-level priority queue: CONTROL > REALTIME > HIGH > NORMAL > LOW"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:34
msgid "流控检查: 发送窗口是否有信用额度"
msgstr "Flow control check: whether the transmit window has credit"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:35
msgid "HARQ 检查: 是否有需要重传的码块"
msgstr "HARQ check: whether there are code blocks requiring retransmission"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:37
msgid "第二步: 帧加密 (可选)"
msgstr "Step 2: Frame Encryption (optional)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:39
msgid "如果链路已开启加密, 调用 `FrameCryptoContext.encrypt()`:"
msgstr ""
"If encryption is enabled on the link, call `FrameCryptoContext.encrypt()`:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:41
msgid "计算 IV: `compute_iv(iv_base, sync_or_link_id, frame_type)`"
msgstr "Compute IV: `compute_iv(iv_base, sync_or_link_id, frame_type)`"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:42
msgid ""
"构建 CCM nonce: `build_ccm_nonce_async(flag, payload_count, direction, iv, "
"data_len)`, 取 B0[1:14] 作为 13 字节 nonce"
msgstr ""
"Build CCM nonce: `build_ccm_nonce_async(flag, payload_count, direction, iv, "
"data_len)`, taking B0[1:14] as the 13-byte nonce"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:43
msgid ""
"AES-CCM 加密: `aes_ccm_encrypt(session_key, nonce, plaintext, aad, mic_len)` →"
" 密文 + MIC"
msgstr ""
"AES-CCM encryption: `aes_ccm_encrypt(session_key, nonce, plaintext, aad, "
"mic_len)` → ciphertext + MIC"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:44 ../../explanation/data-flow.md:176
msgid "payload_count 递增"
msgstr "payload_count incremented"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:46
msgid "第三步: MAC 封帧"
msgstr "Step 3: MAC Frame Encapsulation"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:48
msgid "数据被封装为 `AsyncDataFrame`:"
msgstr "Data is encapsulated into an `AsyncDataFrame`:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:57
msgid "如果数据超过最大 PDU 长度, 按 FIRST / MIDDLE / LAST 分段。"
msgstr ""
"If data exceeds the maximum PDU length, it is segmented as FIRST / MIDDLE / "
"LAST."

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:59
msgid "第四步: 信道编码 (`tx_chain`)"
msgstr "Step 4: Channel Coding (`tx_chain`)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:61
msgid "`mac_to_iq()` 将 MAC 字节转换为比特流, 构建控制信息, 然后调用 `tx_chain()`:"
msgstr ""
"`mac_to_iq()` converts MAC bytes to a bit stream, builds control "
"information, then calls `tx_chain()`:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:63
msgid "头部编码 (`encode_head`)"
msgstr "Header Coding (`encode_head`)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:65
msgid "控制信息比特 (28 或 44 位) 经过:"
msgstr "Control information bits (28 or 44 bits) undergo:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:67
msgid "**Polar 编码**: 按可靠性序列选择信息位位置, 冻结位填零, 蝶形运算生成码字"
msgstr ""
"**Polar coding**: select information bit positions per the reliability "
"sequence, freeze bits set to zero, butterfly operations generate codewords"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:68
msgid "**加扰**: 7 位 Galois LFSR ($x^7 + x^4 + 1$), 异或每个比特"
msgstr "**Scrambling**: 7-bit Galois LFSR ($x^7 + x^4 + 1$), XOR each bit"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:70
msgid "载荷编码 (`encode_payload`)"
msgstr "Payload Coding (`encode_payload`)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:72
msgid "用户数据比特经过:"
msgstr "User data bits undergo:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:74
msgid "**CRC 附加**: 计算 CRC-24 或 CRC-32, 附加到数据尾部"
msgstr "**CRC attachment**: compute CRC-24 or CRC-32, append to data tail"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:75
msgid "**码块分割**: 当编码后比特数超过 Polar 码最大母码长度时, 将数据拆分为多个码块"
msgstr ""
"**Code block segmentation**: when the encoded bit count exceeds the maximum "
"Polar mother code length, split data into multiple code blocks"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:76
msgid "**Polar 编码**: 每个码块独立 Polar 编码, 按 MCS 指定的码率"
msgstr ""
"**Polar coding**: each code block is independently Polar-coded at the rate "
"specified by MCS"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:77
msgid "**加扰**: 与头部使用相同的 LFSR, 异或每个码字比特"
msgstr ""
"**Scrambling**: using the same LFSR as the header, XOR each codeword bit"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:79
msgid "第五步: 帧组装"
msgstr "Step 5: Frame Assembly"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:81
msgid "编码后的比特按帧结构组装:"
msgstr "The encoded bits are assembled according to the frame structure:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:90
msgid ""
"**前导码**: m 序列, 不同帧类型使用不同长度 (FT1: 32 bit, FT2: 64 sym, FT3: 62 sym, FT4: 126 "
"sym)"
msgstr ""
"**Preamble**: m-sequence; different frame types use different lengths (FT1: "
"32 bit, FT2: 64 sym, FT3: 62 sym, FT4: 126 sym)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:91
msgid "**同步序列**: 由 PID 生成, 用于帧同步检测"
msgstr ""
"**Sync sequence**: generated from PID, used for frame synchronization "
"detection"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:92
msgid "**导频**: 按 `pilot_interval` 周期性插入已知符号, 用于信道估计"
msgstr ""
"**Pilots**: known symbols periodically inserted at `pilot_interval` "
"intervals for channel estimation"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:94
msgid "第六步: 调制成型"
msgstr "Step 6: Modulation Shaping"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:96
msgid "**FT1 (GFSK)**: 高斯频移键控, BT = 0.5, 直接调制为瞬时频率变化"
msgstr ""
"**FT1 (GFSK)**: Gaussian frequency shift keying, BT = 0.5, directly "
"modulated as instantaneous frequency deviation"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:97
msgid ""
"**FT2-FT4 (PSK)**: 相移键控 (BPSK/QPSK/8PSK), 先映射星座点, 再经 RRC 脉冲成型滤波 (滚降系数 "
"$\\beta = 0.4$)"
msgstr ""
"**FT2-FT4 (PSK)**: phase-shift keying (BPSK/QPSK/8PSK) — first map to "
"constellation points, then apply RRC pulse-shaping filter (roll-off factor "
"$\\beta = 0.4$)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:99
msgid "输出为复数基带 IQ 信号。"
msgstr "Output is a complex baseband IQ signal."

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:101
msgid "第七步: 射频发送"
msgstr "Step 7: RF Transmission"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:103
msgid "**仿真模式**: IQ 直接进入信道模型"
msgstr "**Simulation mode**: IQ fed directly into the channel model"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:104
msgid "**USRP 模式**: IQ 通过 `SLETransceiver` 发送到 USRP E310 硬件, 上变频到 2.4 GHz 频段"
msgstr ""
"**USRP mode**: IQ sent via `SLETransceiver` to USRP E310 hardware, up-"
"converted to the 2.4 GHz band"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:106
msgid "空口传输"
msgstr "Over-the-Air Transmission"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:108
msgid "信道效应"
msgstr "Channel Effects"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:110
msgid "数据经过无线信道时受到:"
msgstr "Data traversing the wireless channel is subject to:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:112
msgid "**多径衰落**: Rayleigh/Rician 衰落, 多径时延扩展"
msgstr "**Multipath fading**: Rayleigh/Rician fading, multipath delay spread"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:113
msgid "**频率偏移**: 本振不匹配导致的载波频偏"
msgstr ""
"**Frequency offset**: carrier frequency offset caused by local oscillator "
"mismatch"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:114
msgid "**多普勒扩展**: 相对运动引起的时变信道"
msgstr "**Doppler spread**: time-varying channel caused by relative motion"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:115
msgid "**噪声**: 高斯白噪声 (AWGN)"
msgstr "**Noise**: additive white Gaussian noise (AWGN)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:116
msgid "**多用户干扰**: 其他设备同频信号干扰"
msgstr ""
"**Multi-user interference**: co-frequency signal interference from other "
"devices"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:118
msgid "跳频"
msgstr "Frequency Hopping"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:120
msgid "发射和接收两端按相同的跳频序列在 2402-2480 MHz 频段内切换信道, 每个时隙跳到不同频点, 改善频率分集增益并降低窄带干扰影响。"
msgstr ""
"Both transmitter and receiver switch channels in the 2402-2480 MHz band "
"according to the same hopping sequence, jumping to a different frequency "
"point each slot to improve frequency diversity gain and reduce narrowband "
"interference."

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:122
msgid "接收流水线"
msgstr "Receive Pipeline"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:124
msgid "第一步: 射频接收"
msgstr "Step 1: RF Reception"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:126
msgid "**USRP 模式**: 硬件下变频, ADC 采样得到基带 IQ"
msgstr ""
"**USRP mode**: hardware down-conversion, ADC sampling yields baseband IQ"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:127
msgid "**仿真模式**: 从信道模型输出获取 IQ 信号"
msgstr "**Simulation mode**: IQ signal obtained from channel model output"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:129
msgid "第二步: 匹配滤波"
msgstr "Step 2: Matched Filtering"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:131
msgid "**FT1 (GFSK)**: GFSK 解调器直接提取瞬时频率"
msgstr ""
"**FT1 (GFSK)**: GFSK demodulator directly extracts instantaneous frequency"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:132
msgid "**FT2-FT4 (PSK)**: RRC 匹配滤波, 最大化信噪比, 然后降至 1 样本/符号"
msgstr ""
"**FT2-FT4 (PSK)**: RRC matched filtering to maximize SNR, then downsample to"
" 1 sample/symbol"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:134
msgid "第三步: 帧同步 (`frame_sync`)"
msgstr "Step 3: Frame Synchronization (`frame_sync`)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:136
msgid "滑动互相关检测同步序列:"
msgstr "Sliding cross-correlation detects the sync sequence:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:138
msgid "根据帧类型生成同步参考序列"
msgstr "Generate sync reference sequence based on frame type"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:139
msgid "计算接收信号与参考序列的互相关"
msgstr ""
"Compute cross-correlation between received signal and reference sequence"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:140
msgid "峰值超过均值 2 倍时判定同步成功, 返回帧起始位置"
msgstr ""
"When peak exceeds twice the mean, synchronization is declared successful; "
"return frame start position"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:142
msgid "第四步: 帧结构解析"
msgstr "Step 4: Frame Structure Parsing"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:144
msgid "`symbols_to_data_bits()` 根据帧配置参数拆分各段:"
msgstr ""
"`symbols_to_data_bits()` splits the segments according to frame "
"configuration parameters:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:146
msgid "跳过前导码和同步序列"
msgstr "Skip preamble and sync sequence"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:147
msgid "提取头部符号 (固定长度)"
msgstr "Extract header symbols (fixed length)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:148
msgid "提取载荷符号 (长度由头部指示或预知)"
msgstr ""
"Extract payload symbols (length indicated by header or known in advance)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:149
msgid "移除导频符号"
msgstr "Remove pilot symbols"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:151
msgid "第五步: 头部解码 (`decode_head`)"
msgstr "Step 5: Header Decoding (`decode_head`)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:153
msgid "**解扰**: 相同的 LFSR 异或恢复原始码字"
msgstr "**Descrambling**: same LFSR XOR to recover the original codeword"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:154
msgid "**Polar 解码**: SC (逐次消除) 解码, 恢复控制信息比特"
msgstr ""
"**Polar decoding**: SC (successive cancellation) decoding, recover control "
"information bits"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:155
msgid "**CRC-12 校验**: 验证头部完整性"
msgstr "**CRC-12 check**: verify header integrity"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:157
msgid "第六步: 载荷解码 (`decode_payload`)"
msgstr "Step 6: Payload Decoding (`decode_payload`)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:159
msgid "**解扰**: LFSR 异或"
msgstr "**Descrambling**: LFSR XOR"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:160
msgid "**Polar 解码**: 每个码块独立解码"
msgstr "**Polar decoding**: each code block decoded independently"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:161
msgid "**码块重组**: 多个码块合并为完整数据"
msgstr ""
"**Code block reassembly**: multiple code blocks merged into complete data"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:162
msgid "**CRC 校验**: CRC-24 或 CRC-32 验证数据完整性"
msgstr "**CRC check**: CRC-24 or CRC-32 verifies data integrity"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:164
msgid "第七步: MAC 解帧"
msgstr "Step 7: MAC Frame Decapsulation"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:166
msgid "比特流转换为字节: `bits_to_bytes()`"
msgstr "Bit stream converted to bytes: `bits_to_bytes()`"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:167
msgid "解析 `AsyncDataFrame`: 提取分段标志和载荷"
msgstr "Parse `AsyncDataFrame`: extract segmentation flags and payload"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:168
msgid "分段重组: 如有分段, 按序号拼接"
msgstr "Segment reassembly: if segmented, concatenate by sequence number"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:170
msgid "第八步: 帧解密 (可选)"
msgstr "Step 8: Frame Decryption (optional)"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:172
msgid "调用 `FrameCryptoContext.decrypt()`:"
msgstr "Call `FrameCryptoContext.decrypt()`:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:174
msgid "用与发送端相同的参数构建 nonce"
msgstr "Build nonce with the same parameters as the transmitter"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:175
msgid "AES-CCM 解密并验证 MIC"
msgstr "AES-CCM decrypt and verify MIC"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:177
msgid "MIC 验证失败则丢弃"
msgstr "Discard if MIC verification fails"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:179
msgid "第九步: QoS 反馈"
msgstr "Step 9: QoS Feedback"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:181
msgid "ARQ: 发送 ACK/NACK"
msgstr "ARQ: send ACK/NACK"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:182
msgid "HARQ: 反馈 TB 或 CBG 粒度的确认"
msgstr "HARQ: feedback TB or CBG granularity acknowledgement"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:183
msgid "流控: 更新信用额度"
msgstr "Flow control: update credit"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:184
msgid "质量跟踪: 更新帧错误率统计, 推荐 MCS"
msgstr "Quality tracking: update frame error rate statistics, recommend MCS"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:186
msgid "MAC-PHY 适配层"
msgstr "MAC-PHY Adaptation Layer"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:188
msgid "`phy.mac_interface` 模块是 MAC 和 PHY 之间的桥接:"
msgstr "The `phy.mac_interface` module bridges MAC and PHY:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:7
msgid "函数"
msgstr "Function"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:7
msgid "方向"
msgstr "Direction"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:7
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:7
