msgstr "Bits → bytes"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:199
msgid "SleNode 集成"
msgstr "SleNode Integration"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:201
msgid "`SleNode` 是将所有功能集成到一个实体的节点类:"
msgstr ""
"`SleNode` is the node class integrating all functionality into a single "
"entity:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:216
msgid "数据流路径:"
msgstr "Data flow paths:"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:218
msgid ""
"**发送**: `send(data)` → 入队 → `transmit()` → QoS → 加密 → MAC → PHY → IQ → 空口"
msgstr ""
"**Transmit**: `send(data)` → enqueue → `transmit()` → QoS → encrypt → MAC → "
"PHY → IQ → air"

#: ../../explanation/data-flow.md:219
msgid ""
"**接收**: 空口 → IQ → `receive()` → PHY → MAC → 解密 → QoS 反馈 → "
"`on_data_received()`"
msgstr ""
"**Receive**: air → IQ → `receive()` → PHY → MAC → decrypt → QoS feedback → "
"`on_data_received()`"
